        "subject": "Approval required",
        "message": "=<!--\n  Document Approval Request Email Template\n  -----------------------------------------\n\n  If sending via n8n's Send Email node, swap these for expressions\n  referencing your workflow data, and set the node's content type to HTML.\n-->\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Request for Document Review</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#f4f4f4; padding: 32px 16px;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\">\n\n          <!-- Header -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color:#1a3c6e; padding:24px 32px;\">\n              <h1 style=\"margin:0; color:#ffffff; font-size:20px; font-weight:600;\">Review Request: CCTEC Power Consumption Record</h1>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Body -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding:32px;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">\n                Good day Sir,\n              </p>\n\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">\n                Kindly find attached the <strong>CCTEC Power Consumption Record</strong> for your review. I would be grateful\n                if you could go through the figures and confirm that everything is accurate and in order.\n              </p>\n\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">\n                Once you've confirmed it reflects what it should, I will proceed to forward it to the\n                Accounts Department. Please let me know if any adjustments are needed before then.\n              </p>\n\n              <!-- CTA Button -->\n              <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0 auto 24px auto;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td align=\"center\" style=\"border-radius:6px; background-color:#1a3c6e;\">\n                    <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Ki1blhZxwS6cQXVJbu1bwQF55lG3DKTA1NEV-2esEvI/edit?gid=0#gid=0\"\n                       target=\"_blank\"\n                       style=\"display:inline-block; padding:12px 28px; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px;\">\n                      Review Document\n                    </a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#333333;\">\n                I look forward to your feedback or approval at your earliest convenience.\n              </p>\n\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color:#f0f0f0; padding:16px 32px; text-align:center;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:12px; color:#999999;\">\n                This message requires your review before further action is taken.\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>",
